{"id": "sfo-aeromexico-landing-weight-fees", "title": "Aeromexico counted the flights but understated their landing weight", "seconds": 65.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "218400f6db124144", "words": 168, "beats": [{"scene": "aircraft", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Aeromexico reported 2,030 revenue passenger landings across two fiscal years.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.96, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "did", "the", "radar", "count?"], "sub": "Aeromexico landing fees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.65, 1.06, 1.29, 1.71, 2.06, 2.42, 2.89, 3.31, 3.67, 3.94, 4.36]}, {"scene": "aircraft", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "For November 2014, radar confirmed 85 landings. The schedule listed 98.", "t0": 5.08, "t1": 11.52, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "November 2014", "heading": "The schedule and the radar", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Flight schedule", "value": "98 landings"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Radar and airline report", "value": "85 landings"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.56, 0.82, 1.97, 2.36, 2.84, 3.4, 4.46, 4.63, 5.13, 5.69]}, {"scene": "aircraft", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The airline reported every landing as a Boeing 737-700.", "t0": 11.64, "t1": 15.87, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "Aircraft types in the audit", "mark": "Aircraft types in the audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 0.99, 1.23, 1.64, 1.78, 1.85, 2.2, 2.45, 2.73, 3.61]}, {"scene": "aircraft", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Radar also showed 737-800s, which carry a higher landing weight.", "t0": 15.99, "t1": 21.03, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Aircraft types"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.86, 1.18, 1.51, 1.82, 3.33, 3.6, 3.91, 3.99, 4.3, 4.64]}, {"scene": "aircraft", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors found more than sixteen million pounds of underreported weight.", "t0": 21.15, "t1": 24.76, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "16,460,000", "label": "Pounds of understated landing weight"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.8, 1.02, 1.22, 1.69, 2.02, 2.41, 2.53, 3.17]}, {"scene": "charges", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The 2014 bond statement identified Aeromexico as a non-signatory airline.", "t0": 24.98, "t1": 29.93, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "bonds", "kicker": "San Francisco Airport Commission", "text": "2014 Airport bond statement", "mark": "2014 Airport bond statement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 0.94, 1.24, 1.7, 2.25, 3.16, 3.37, 3.45, 4.24]}, {"scene": "charges", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The applicable rates were $5.36 and $5.71 per thousand pounds.", "t0": 30.05, "t1": 36.18, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "The applicable rates included the non-signatory premium", "heading": "Per thousand pounds across the two fiscal years", "source": "financials", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "First year", "value": "$5.36"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Second year", "value": "$5.71"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.63, 0.9, 1.11, 1.41, 1.76, 1.9, 2.42, 3.0, 3.28, 3.58, 3.97, 4.15, 4.74, 5.06, 5.24, 5.62]}, {"scene": "charges", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The reported $92,319 shortfall falls within the range those rates imply.", "t0": 36.3, "t1": 42.09, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$92,319", "label": "Underpayment calculated by the auditors"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.62, 1.06, 1.5, 1.71, 1.95, 2.3, 2.62, 3.59, 3.96, 4.23, 4.36, 4.75, 5.01, 5.27]}, {"scene": "charges", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Airport identified the aircraft discrepancy in January 2016.", "t0": 42.21, "t1": 45.85, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "2016 billing changes", "mark": "2016 billing changes"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.49, 0.99, 1.1, 1.54, 2.15, 2.27, 2.75, 3.05]}, {"scene": "charges", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In March the Airport switched to radar-based landing fee billing.", "t0": 45.97, "t1": 48.91, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "March 2016"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.45, 0.55, 0.94, 1.3, 1.46, 2.05, 2.41, 2.58]}, {"scene": "charges", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Airport agreed to collect the shortfall. Interest applied only to late invoice payments.", "t0": 49.03, "t1": 54.2, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "Collection recommendation", "mark": "Collection recommendation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.59, 0.96, 1.09, 1.39, 1.5, 2.65, 3.1, 3.55, 3.8, 3.94, 4.19, 4.6]}, {"scene": "charges", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Controller later listed all four recommendations as closed.", "t0": 54.32, "t1": 57.54, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "followup", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "2018 follow-up", "mark": "2018 follow-up"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.65, 0.9, 1.26, 1.55, 1.82, 2.52, 2.66]}, {"scene": "charges", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The closure list gives no collection amount or result of the earlier-period review.", "t0": 57.66, "t1": 61.63, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Payment record", "Older landing reports"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.48, 0.7, 0.98, 1.16, 1.58, 1.84, 1.97, 2.37, 2.49, 2.61, 3.31]}, {"scene": "charges", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 61.75, "t1": 64.12, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"aircraft": "The aircraft type changed the fee", "charges": "Check the historic rate"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "question"}